<h1>Spot It, Fix It</h1>

<p>Time to put POUR to work on a real page. Below is a mock umbrella shop with four accessibility issues built in, one for each POUR principle. Read each issue, choose the principle it violates, then practice writing the piece of a prompt that would fix it.</p>

## POUR Principles
- **Perceivable** - users can see or hear the information on the page.
- **Operable** - users can interact with the page and its features.
- **Understandable** - users can figure out what to do and how to do it.
- **Robust** - it works in different situations and with different tools.


